  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>18</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>and coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>b</mi></math></p><p>Coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math> are zero.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>18</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>32</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving Eqs. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>272</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
